---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components bundled with the installer
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org)
  The installer ships the static FFmpeg and FFprobe binaries provided by the
  `ffmpeg-static` and `ffprobe-static` npm packages. Those builds are licensed
  under the GNU General Public License v3 (and FFmpeg's LGPL where applicable).
  Source code and build scripts: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html
  Because the distributed binaries are GPLv3, redistribution of this installer
  is subject to the GPLv3 for those components. The application source code in
  this repository remains MIT licensed. FFmpeg is invoked as a separate
  executable over its command-line interface.

uiohook-napi (https://github.com/SnosMe/uiohook-napi)
  MIT licensed. Optional native module used for global mouse/keyboard capture;
  the app runs without it (effects are then limited to in-app events).

Electron (https://www.electronjs.org) - MIT licensed.
React (https://react.dev) - MIT licensed.
Zustand (https://github.com/pmndrs/zustand) - MIT licensed.
Tailwind CSS (https://tailwindcss.com) - MIT licensed.
electron-vite, Vite, TypeScript, electron-builder - MIT licensed.
